s connect nodes '1' and '3' from 'node1' to nodes '1' and '3' from 'node2',=
 respectively, labeled 'compare'.  To the right, a gray box describes a che=
ck:  '2. check that dfs(node1.left, node2.right) and dfs(node1.right, node2=
.left) are True,' indicating a depth-first search comparison between the sp=
ecified subtrees to verify their structural equality." loading=3D"lazy" wid=
