:transparent" src=3D"https://bytebytego.com/images/courses/coding-patterns/=
trees/binary-tree-symmetry/image-11-09-3-XARCKGSV.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxF=
QGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>If either DFS call returns false, the subtrees are not symmetric. If bot=
h DFS calls return true, the subtrees are symmetric. This process is repeat=
ed for the entire tree.</p>
